        "cooked": "<p>When Price of Freedom Wraith is incapped, one of her abilities reads as follows:</p><blockquote><p>Put 1 Ongoing card on top of its associated deck.</p></blockquote><p>We played a game last night where this ability was CRUCIAL. We interpreted this as \"take an ongoing card from ANYWHERE on top of its associated deck (trash, hand or field; not deck). Is this a correct interpretation? We helped keep heroes alive by allowing Naturalist recycle his Indomitable Force while in Rhinoceros form, tanking just about everything in sight. We fought the Ennead on challenge mode, so allowing Set to play the top ongoing was a very potent combo after Wraith sent it to the top.</p>",
